; Local and global variables, aliases, command substitution (Phase 221)
FailAt 21
Unset Kickstart
Unset Workbench
Unset process
Set myvar hello world
Echo "[$myvar]"
Echo "[${myvar}!]"
Get myvar
Set quoted "a  b"
Echo "[$quoted]"
Set empty
Echo "[$empty]"
Set
Unset myvar
Get myvar
Echo "get rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Echo "[$myvar]"
Echo "*$quoted"
Echo $nosuchvar
Set n 5
Set m `Eval $n + 1`
Echo "m=$m"
SetEnv ptgenv gval
GetEnv ptgenv
Echo "env=$ptgenv"
Set ptgenv local
Echo "local wins=$ptgenv"
Unset ptgenv
Echo "global again=$ptgenv"
UnSetEnv ptgenv
GetEnv ptgenv
Echo "getenv rc=$RC"
Alias
Alias ll List
Alias xx "Echo [] end"
Alias yy Echo prefix
Alias
Alias ll
xx middle
yy tail
Unalias ll
Alias
Unalias xx
Unalias yy
Alias
Echo "done"
